  "title": "One Full Image to Class-Specific Box Scores",
  "introduction": "Let IMG contain an object OBJ whose center CTR lies in cell CELL. YOLO evaluates the full image once, predicts box data and one shared conditional class distribution per cell, then forms each class-specific box score as $\\Pr(\\mathrm{Class}_i\\mid\\mathrm{Object})C_b$.",
