      "title": "Form a class-specific box score",
      "explanation": "BOX1 contributes C1 and the shared cell distribution contributes CLSi. The scoring operation computes $\\Pr(\\mathrm{Class}_i\\mid\\mathrm{Object})C_1$, yielding SCOREi for BOX1. Because $C_1$ carries object-presence and localization-fit semantics, SCOREi combines class belief with the predicted box's confidence.",
